{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve existing no-argument overrides. A subclass that previously customized `XRayContextExtractor.extract()` now inherits this overload, so any non-empty invocation header bypasses its override and silently changes trace IDs or sampling. Delegate to `extract()` for subclasses that have not explicitly overridden `extract(InvocationInfo)`, and add a regression test for that case.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74iFs3","finding_digest":"30b6e9f497108c4e3e7bf298201ee360d0b10c72226617af26a231f2d2bf3206","finding_id":"arf_v1_gc3ot5exccge4pt36kmcahxdmd","finding_key":"otel-plugin/xraycontextextractor::extract-invocationinfo::legacy-subclass-override-dispatch","identity_key":"otel-plugin/xraycontextextractor::extract-invocationinfo::legacy-subclass-override-dispatch","line":36,"observation_digest":"561cd637bbc572e01ee5c2ce669359e2e4f9cf7826ff868609be609ed59db2e8","observation_id":"aro_v1_kyonmn53yvzoahxfylhgne2z4l","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/XRayContextExtractor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-02T20:45:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nyyubnzazkm2ueiaf4gjfgng6d","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"45d5feeb2b73b89d44ba4e213ee8c4f71d5eb450","reviewer":"codex","start_line":32,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_kvrvhqv6qykxwokqhymo6kglpj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T20:45:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
